 </span><span begin="00:23.575" end="00:23.889">be </span><span begin="00:23.889" end="00:24.896">mine</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.599" end="00:28.544"><span begin="00:24.599" end="00:25.077">But </span><span begin="00:25.077" end="00:25.457">here </span><span begin="00:25.457" end="00:25.743">we </span><span begin="00:25.743" end="00:26.775">are </span><span begin="00:26.775" end="00:27.100">we're </span><span begin="00:27.100" end="00:27.380">here </span><span begin="00:27.380" end="00:28.537">tonight</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.246" end="00:35.962"><span begin="00:28.246" end="00:31.296">Singing </span><span begin="00:31.296" end="00:32.162">Amen </span><span begin="00:32.162" end="00:32.885">I'm </span><span begin="00:32.885" end="00:35.959">alive</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.662" end="00:42.556"><span begin="00:35.662" end="00:37.792">Singing </span><span begin="00:37.792" end="00:39.362">Amen </span><span begin="00:39.362" end="00:40.053">I'm </span><span begin="00:40.053" end="00:42.547">alive</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.256" end="00:46.757"><span begin="00:42.256" end="00:43.314">If </span><span begin="00:43.314" end="00:43.557">everyone </span><span begin="00:43.557" end="00:44.919">cared </span><span begin="00:44.919" end="00:45.221">and </span><span begin="00:45.221" end="00:45.463">nobody </span><span begin="00:45.463" end="00:46.749">cried</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.457" end="00:50.346"><span begin="00:46.457" end="00:47.004">If </span><span begin="00:47.004" end="00:47.261">everyone </span><span begin="00:47.261" end="00:48.548">loved </span><span begin="00:48.548" end="00:48.841">and </span><span begin="00:48.841" end="00:49.223">nobody </span><span begin="00:49.223" end="00:50.339">lied</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.046" end="00:53.912"><span begin="00:50.046" end="00:50.666">If </span><span begin="00:50.666" end="00:50.895">everyone </span><span begin="00:50.895" end="00:52.