in </span><span begin="01:19.847" end="01:21.302">paradise</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.009" end="01:24.902"><span begin="01:21.009" end="01:21.637">We'll </span><span begin="01:21.637" end="01:21.933">show </span><span begin="01:21.933" end="01:22.224">the </span><span begin="01:22.224" end="01:23.114">world </span><span begin="01:23.114" end="01:23.403">they </span><span begin="01:23.403" end="01:23.629">were </span><span begin="01:23.629" end="01:24.896">wrong</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.602" end="01:28.590"><span begin="01:24.602" end="01:25.186">And </span><span begin="01:25.186" end="01:25.456">teach </span><span begin="01:25.456" end="01:26.680">them </span><span begin="01:26.680" end="01:26.950">all </span><span begin="01:26.950" end="01:27.173">to </span><span begin="01:27.173" end="01:27.446">sing </span><span begin="01:27.446" end="01:28.583">along</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.290" end="01:35.907"><span begin="01:28.290" end="01:30.501">Singing </span><span begin="01:30.501" end="01:32.136">Amen </span><span begin="01:32.136" end="01:32.538">I'm </span><span begin="01:32.538" end="01:35.902">alive</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.607" end="01:42.437"><span begin="01:35.607" end="01:37.738">Singing </span><span begin="01:37.738" end="01:39.317">Amen </span><span begin="01:39.317" end="01:39.951">I'm </span><span begin="01:39.951" end="01:42.435">alive</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.137" end="01:46.624"><span begin="01:42.137" end="01:43.281">If </span><span begin="01:43.281" end="01:43.778">everyone </span><span begin="01:43.778" end="01:44.899">cared </span><span begin="01:44.899" end="01:45.227">and </span><span begin="01:45.227" end="01:45.446">nobody </span><span begin="01:45.446" end="01:46.622">cried</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.324" end="01:50.293"><span begin="01:46.324" end="01:46.990">If </span><span begin="01:46.990" end="01:47.245">everyone </span><span begin="01:47.245" end="01:48.557">loved </span><span begin="01:48.557" end="01:48.821">and </span><span begin="01:48.821" end="01:49.144">nobody </span><span begin="01:49.144" end="01:50.290">lied</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.993" end="01:53.885"><span begin="01:49.993" end="01:50.637">If </span><span begin="01:50.637" end="01:50.879">everyone </span><span begin="01:50.879" end="01:52.191">shared </span><span begin="01:52.191" end="01:52.419">and </span><span begin="01:52.419" end="01:52.706">swallowed </span><span begin="01:52.706" end="01:53.078">their </span><span begin="01:53.078" end="01:53.885">pride</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.585" end="01:57.629"><span begin="01:53.585" end="01:54.210">We'd </span><span begin="01:54.210" end="01:54.461">see </span><span begin="01:54.461" end="01:54.731">the </span><span begin="01:54.731" end="01:55.805">day </span><span begin="01:55.805" end="01:56.031">when </span><span begin="01:56.031" end="01:56.304">nobody </span><span begin="01:56.304" end="01:57.621">died</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.329" end="02:01.186"><span begin="01:57.329" end="01:57.931">If </span><span begin="01:57.931" end="01:58.179">everyone </span><span begin="01:58.179" end="01:59.395">cared </span><span begin="01:59.395" end="01:59.672">and </span><span begin="01:59.672" end="02:00.016">nobody </span><span begin="02:00.016" end="02:01.182">cried</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.886" end="02:04.821"><span begin="02:00.886" end="02:01.446">If </span><span begin="02:01.446" end="02:01.749">everyone </span><span begin="02:01.749" end="02:03.000">loved </span><span begin="02:03.000" end="02:03.309">and </span><span begin="02:03.309" end="02:03.621">nobody </span><span begin="02:03.621" end="02:04.817">lied</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.521" end="02:08.480"><span begin="02:04.521" end="02:05.125">If </span><span begin="02:05.125" end="02:05.405">everyone </span><span begin="02:05.405" end="02:06.688">shared </span><span begin="02: